Cheese shop in France? 🧀🇫🇷 Ask for this

• un fromage = a cheese
• pas trop fort = not too strong
• je peux goûter ? = can I taste?
• un morceau = a piece
• doux = mild

💌 Save this for your next French dinner
👯 Send it to a cheese lover

Small steps. Big dreams ✨

